<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Imam Khomeini in Lebanon | Skywork</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Tahoma', sans-serif;
      background-color: #0f0f0f;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      background: url('A_historical_photograph_captures_an_elderly_Irania.png') center/cover no-repeat;
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .overlay {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }
    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 800px;
      padding: 20px;
      animation: fadeIn 2s ease-in-out;
    }
    .hero-content h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #e0e0e0;
    }
    .hero-content p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #cccccc;
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    .footer {
      background: #111;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 15px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #666;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Imam Khomeini Walks Through the Ruins of Lebanon</h1>
      <p>In a symbolic moment, Imam Khomeini is depicted walking solemnly through the devastated streets of Lebanon, following the recent war. His black robe mirrors the mourning of a nation, reflecting resistance and resilience amidst the rubble.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="footer">
    &copy; 2025 Skywork | All rights reserved.
  </div>

</body>
</html>
